        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You conjure forth stationary tentacles formed from pure, partially hardened blood. You create up to 3 Medium thralls shaped like bloody tendrils in range. These tendrils are immune to physical damage and can't move. The tendril's Strike has a reach of 10 feet. Whenever an enemy ends it turn within the reach of one or more tendrils, the tendril lashes out at them, dealing 1d12 bludgeoning damage with a basic Reflex save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+3)</strong> The number of thralls this spell can create increases by 1, and the damage increases by 1d12.</p>"
